      49.81,
      428.97,
      540.93,
      456.59
    ],
    "text": "Recruitment to the Post of Provincial Director of Agriculture in the Department of Agriculture of North Western Province",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      467.39,
      542.51,
      518.06
    ],
    "text": "IN accordance with the recommendation of the Chief Secretary of the North Western Province and the approval of the Honorable Governor, applications are invited from Grade I officers of the Sri Lanka Agriculture Service who are currently serving in either the public service or the provincial public service, for appointment to the vacant post of Provincial Director in the Department of Agriculture in North Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      529.23,
      125.25,
      543.07
    ],
    "text": "01. Qualifications:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      75.01,
      554.19,
      521.03,
      567.66
    ],
    "text": "(i.) Should be a Grade I (Class 1) officer of Sri Lanka Agriculture Service with active and satisfactory service.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      75.01,
      572.59,
      479.39,
      586.06
    ],
    "text": "(ii.) Should be affiliated with the Agricultural Development Stream in Sri Lanka Agriculture Service",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      75.01,
      590.99,
      256.22,
      604.46
    ],
    "text": "(iii.) Should have excellent moral character.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      75.01,
      609.39,
      352.26,
      622.86
    ],
    "text": "(iv.) Should have fulfilled all necessary qualifications by 30.11.2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      84.01,
      634.19,
      542.52,
      672.46
    ],
    "text": "Note: These qualifications must be completed by the closing date of applications and self-attested photocopies of all certificates proving the above qualifications and National Identity Card must be sent along with the application form.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItal",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      68.88,
      521.7,
      93.0
    ],
    "text": "IV (wd) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'11'14Part IV(B) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 14.11.20252A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      98.37,
      158.52,
      112.21
    ],
    "text": "02. Selection Procedure:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      123.33,
      549.82,
      161.6
    ],
    "text": "In a structured interview conducted by an interview panel nominated by the Secretary to the Governor of North Western Province with the approval of the Honorable Governor of North Western Province, the selection will be made based on the merit order of the marks obtained at the interview.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      172.77,
      177.27,
      186.61
    ],
    "text": "03. Submitting Applications:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      197.73,
      550.01,
      322.8
    ],
    "text": "Duly and correctly completed applications (the Model application form can be downloaded from www.psc.nw.gov.lk) should be sent by registered post to the address \u201cSecretary to the Governor, Governor\u2019s Office, Maligawa, Kurunegala\u201d through the Head of the Department and the Secretary to the concerned Ministry (If you are an officer who has been absorbed into the Provincial Council, your application should be forwarded with the recommendations of the Secretary to Provincial Ministry and the Chief Secretary.) to be received on or before 30.11.2025. \u201cCalling of applications for the posts of Provincial Agricultural Director in the Department of Agriculture of North Western Province\u201d should be written on the top left-hand corner of the envelope containing the application. Late applications, incomplete, applications, and the applications submitted by applicants whose eligibility requirements are not completed by the closing date will be rejected without prior notice. The Office of the Governor of the North Western Province will not entertain any complaints regarding late or lost applications.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      334.13,
      549.8,
      360.0
    ],
    "text": "The Honorable Governor of the North Western Province has the authority to decide on matters not provided for in this recruitment notice.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.3,
      371.33,
      547.44,
      384.8
    ],
    "text": "In case of any inconsistency between the Sinhala, Tamil and English texts of this notice, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      396.13,
      549.8,
      422.0
    ],
    "text": "The decision of the Honorable Governor of the North Western Province regarding recruitment for this post shall be final and conclusive.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      172.11,
      433.33,
      430.51,
      446.8
    ],
    "text": "By order of the Honorable Governor of North Western Province,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      458.13,
      517.56,
      496.4
    ],
    "text": "Secretary to the Governor. Governor\u2019s Office,North Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
